# Read-Before-Write Rule

Before modifying any file:

1. Identify boundaries — interfaces, types, schemas
2. Read upstream via @filename
3. State signatures in plan
4. Then edit

## Critique Checklist

- Null/empty values
- Network timeouts
- Race conditions
- Unhandled exceptions

## UTF-8 & Verification

- Write all text files as UTF-8 without BOM (never UTF-16)
- Never mark BUILD_PLAN tasks complete without running validate scripts
- Run `python3 scripts/agent-run.py validate-bootstrap --quick` after creating Sprint 0 artifacts
- Sprint 0 sign-off (canonical): `validate-bootstrap --quick`, `feature-gate --stack <active>`, `check-github-ci --wait 300`, `check-license-compliance` via `python3 scripts/agent-run.py` — see `BUILD_PLAN.md` Child Repo Playbook
